<Page title="About grassfed.food" crumb="About" description="grassfed.food is a dated, verified directory of US farms selling grass-fed meat and dairy, with plain guides to labels and buying.">
  <p class="lede">grassfed.food helps you buy grass-fed meat and dairy directly from the farms that raise it.</p>
  <p>Finding a grass-fed farm should be simple, but existing directories make it hard to tell which farms finish their animals on grass, which are certified, and whether a listing is still current. We built grassfed.food to fix those three things: filters for the claims that matter, certifications checked at the source, and a date on every listing.</p>
  <p>Our guides cover what labels mean, how to buy a quarter or half of a steer, and how delivery services compare, with sources for every claim.</p>
